          "docs": "<p>The DeletePipeline operation removes a pipeline.</p> <p> You can only delete a pipeline that has never been used or that is not currently in use (doesn't contain any active jobs). If the pipeline is currently in use, <code>DeletePipeline</code> returns an error. </p>"
        },
