          "docs": "<p>With the UpdatePipelineNotifications operation, you can update Amazon Simple Notification Service (Amazon SNS) notifications for a pipeline.</p> <p>When you update notifications for a pipeline, Elastic Transcoder returns the values that you specified in the request.</p>"
